    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 12px; color: #7a9ab0; line-height: 1.8;">
        <strong>Weight comparison:</strong> Toyota Corolla 2025 (compact car) ≈ 3,100 lbs. Phase 6 steam car ≈ 1,655 lbs
        (47% lighter). This reduction is achieved through: (1) smaller, lower-displacement steam engine vs. 1.6L gas engine,
        (2) dual batteries instead of 12V + fuel tank, (3) aluminum body panels instead of full steel unibody,
        (4) 2-seat minimalist interior. Lower weight improves acceleration, braking, handling, and overall efficiency.
    </p>

